# Privacy Policy

This Discord bot may process information provided by Discord that is necessary for its operation, such as Discord user IDs, server IDs, channel IDs, message content submitted to the bot, and command inputs.

Information is used only to provide and improve the bot's functionality.

The bot does not sell personal information to third parties.

Information may be temporarily stored when necessary for operation, logging, troubleshooting, security, or functionality provided by the bot.

Users may contact the bot owner to request deletion of stored personal information where applicable.

Discord itself may separately collect and process information according to Discord's own Privacy Policy.

This Privacy Policy may be updated as the bot's functionality changes.

